# What the types job checks the type hints with (ci.yml): the checker, and what the package and the tools that build it
# import that has type hints of its own (numpy, packaging) or stubs (pandas, setuptools: setuptools itself has none for
# mypy to use, and the stubs do not need it installed). The other libraries that the package imports (astropy, astroquery,
# ebf, h5py, pathos, vaex) have none that mypy finds: see [tool.mypy] in pyproject.toml. The stubs of pandas are those of
# the pandas that setup.py allows (2.x).
mypy
numpy
packaging
pandas-stubs<3
types-setuptools
